  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "えんとつやまで　てにいれた　いんせき。\nなにかの　もんようが　うかびあがり\nなないろの　ひかりが　あふれだす。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "굴뚝산에서 손에 넣은 운석.\n어떤 문양이 드러나며\n일곱 색깔의 빛이 넘쳐난다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在煙囪山上獲得的隕石。\n上面浮現出某種花紋，\n並流瀉著七色光芒。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une météorite trouvée au Mont Chimnée.\nUn étrange symbole est gravé à sa surface,\net luit des sept couleurs de l’arc-en-ciel.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Meteorit, den du beim Schlotberg erhalten hast.\nEr ist seltsam gemustert und aus seinem Inneren\nstrahlt ein regenbogenfarbenes Licht.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Meteorito obtenido en el Monte Cenizo. Presenta\nunos peculiares grabados e irradia una luz con los\nsiete colores del arcoíris.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Meteorite ottenuto sul Monte Camino.\nSulla superficie è visibile un motivo in rilievo\nche brilla dei colori dell’arcobaleno.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Meteorite that you got at Mt. Chimney.\nSome sort of pattern has risen to the surface,\nand it’s shining with seven colors of light.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "えんとつ山で　手に入れた　いんせき。\nなにかの　文様が　浮かび上がり\n七色の　光が　あふれだす。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在烟囱山上获得的陨石。\n上面浮现着某些花纹，\n并散发着七色光芒。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
